/** @page building Building

The game is built with Zig 0.17.1 on Linux, Windows, macOS, and Emscripten.
See the repository README for platform prerequisites and build/run commands.

The build creates separate Shared, nCine, and Jazz2 game libraries. SDL2 provides
windowing, input, controllers, and queued audio. Rendering uses desktop OpenGL
3.3 or WebGL 2. Codec and scripting dependencies have individual Zig builds in
@cpp deps/ @ce.

ShaderCompiler runs on the build host, including for cross-compilation. It
processes the shader sources and includes automatically and writes C++ headers
to Zig's build cache. Generated headers are not source-controlled. The graphics
driver compiles the generated GLSL at runtime. @cpp zig build shaders @ce runs
the generation step independently.

@cpp zig build tools @ce builds ShaderCompiler and AssetPacker for the host.
AssetPacker conversions run explicitly with @cpp zig build pack-assets -- ... @ce.
Original Jazz Jackrabbit 2 game data is supplied by the user and is never needed
by the build itself.

@cpp zig build test @ce runs shared-library regression checks without game data.
*/
